            0.879,
            0.63
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A.朴素的（即未经过其他优化实现的）快速排序算法在任何情况下都比朴素的归并排序算法要快。B. 快速排序算法在最佳情况下的时间复杂度是0(nlgn)。C. 归并排序算法在最差情况下的时间复杂度是0(nlgn)。D.为了提高快速排序的运行效率，可以在选择枢轴（主元/划分元）时 D.为了提高快速排序的运行效率，可以在选择枢轴（主元/划分元）时"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.61,
            0.872,
            0.662
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "采用随机化方法。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.674,
            0.866,
            0.728
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 以下哪个时间复杂度不是渐进意义下的“快”（)。A. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Theta ( n ^ { 2 } )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " B, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Theta ( n ^ { 1 0 0 0 } )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C. Θ(n!) D. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Theta ( \\lg ^ { 1 0 0 } n )"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.737,
            0.753,
            0.888
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 以下关于渐近时间复杂度的描述中，不正确的是（ )。A. 若 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\overline { { T } } ( n ) \\in O ( n )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，则一定有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "T ( n ) \\in 0 ( n ^ { 2 } )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " B. 若 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "T ( n ) \\in O ( n )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，则一定有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "T ( n ) \\in 0 ( 2 ^ { n } )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C. 若 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "T ( n ) \\in \\Omega ( n )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，则一定有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "T ( n ) \\in \\Omega ( 1 )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " D. 若 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "T ( n ) \\in \\Omega ( n )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，则一定有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "T ( n ) \\in \\Omega ( n ^ { 2 } )"
            }
          ]
        },
